--- !u!114 &5253019803070172001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2749677302021931688}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ab10d3bc65903e45adae594c3b4cc5b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  textOptions:
  - text: Hello World!
  - text: 'Hello!

      Always nice to stumble on a pal while I am out and about!'
  - text: 'Be careful of the big monsters lurking around.

      Sometimes they call
      in minions if you hit them.

      If you dispatch the minions you should be
      able

      to hit the big boss again!'
  - text: 'We are pretty lucky! If we get destroyed we

      can always reinstantiate.


      It
      is a little painful though!'
  - text: 'We always say that VNTs remind us of eating.

      I kinda wonder how
      we know what eating is tho.


      We don''t  even have mouths!'
  - text: 'If you can try hitting monsters in a chain.

      Thay seem to give more
      points that way.

      ...

      I mean VNTs!'
  - text: 'If you can try hitting monsters in a chain.

      Thay seem to give more
      points that way.

      ...

      I mean VNTs!'
  - text: 'I have heard rumors that there is a secret

      area hidden down below
      sector 0-0.


      I wonder what is down there!'
  - text: Phew, feels like I have been climbing forever!
  - text: 'Sometimes you can reach tricky places by

      jumping off a wall then
      dashing back towards it.'
  - text: "A long time ago us RABITs inscribed data\ninto some of the CAROTs describing
      the \ngreat change."
  - text: 'I wonder why the Creators built this place


      It certainly quite
      large...'
  - text: 'Those faces on the walls sometimes creep

      me out a little bit.


      Some
      say they are the faces of the creators...'
  - text: 'No matter how many times we decompile

      monsters they keep coming
      back.


      I guess they are like us in that way...'
  - text: 'Keep an eye out for secret passages!


      Sometimes you can walk right
      through suspiscious walls!'
  - text: Take care of yourself!
  - text: '*yawn*'
  - text: '*yawn*

      I need a nap...'
  - text: Oh, Hello!
  - text: 'Ever notice how things don''t always line up here?

      The lifts all
      seem to be going up a single passage,

      but you can walk horizontally
      to find the next one.

      It klinda weirds me out...'
  - text: Stay safe out there!
